&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s3&quot;&gt;● &lt;/span&gt;Background in platform or ecosystem sales (e.g., SaaS, marketplaces, or embedded&amp;nbsp;finance).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s3&quot;&gt;● &lt;/span&gt;Experience selling into or partnering with enterprise software, vertical SaaS, or global&amp;nbsp;marketplace businesses.&lt;/p&gt;
