&lt;li&gt;Partner with your executive to track key project milestones as well as progress against personal, team, and company goals and targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish new—and improve existing—administrative systems and processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the operations and culture of various Stripe teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
