&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to establish new administrative systems and processes and improve existing ones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and manage ad hoc projects as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build cross-functional relationships across departments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support general office duties as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
