&lt;li&gt;You’re highly organized, with strong attention to detail and an ability to execute&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have excellent time management skills and can quickly shift tasks and priorities as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can work across roles and teams in a fast-paced, changing environment while remaining flexible, proactive, resourceful, and efficient&lt;/li&gt;
