&lt;li&gt;A PhD, MS, or BS in a quantitative field (e.g., Statistics, Operations Research, Economics, Computer Science, Engineering)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have at least 3 years of direct management experience leading data science or ML teams, and 10 years of overall data science experience.&lt;/li&gt;
