&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5 to 10 years of experience in sales, business development, or a related field, including experience selling a technical product and a record of strong performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience selling technical products within fintech, crypto, or a related industry. You can build a pipeline, lead complex sales cycles, and develop trusted relationships with commercial and technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading complex, multi-stakeholder enterprise deals involving legal, compliance, engineering, and other buyer-side teams through contract close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work effectively in an early-stage environment and build repeatable processes where none exist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building strong networks within a specific industry, ideally fintech, payments, or crypto.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication, negotiation, relationship management, and sales skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling API-first or developer-focused products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead discovery conversations with technical buyers, including chief technology officers and product leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with crypto infrastructure, such as stablecoins, on-ramps and off-ramps, wallets, and custody, or a demonstrated ability to learn the space quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
