&lt;li&gt;Experience with payments risk (CNP and card testing, ATO, merchant fraud, transaction fraud) and familiarity with how upstream detection and downstream enforcement interact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytics proficiency (building and owning dashboards, querying data directly) and comfort partnering deeply with data science and engineering&lt;/li&gt;
