&lt;li&gt;Implement sophisticated&amp;nbsp; sales methodologies to systematically identify who the best Startups to go after are, balancing the need to both capture the highest potential startups but also consider how to achieve scaled acquisition across a broader base&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster executive-level relationships with key prospects, serving as Stripe&#39;s senior representative in deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create specialized strategies to localise regional sales plays and increase product adoption at point of acquisition across each region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Product, Marketing, Solution Architects, and Sales Finance to develop compelling value propositions for new opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement strategies to&amp;nbsp; improve sales cycles and user activations across across the region&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish metrics and accountability frameworks to drive consistent performance across all teams&lt;/li&gt;
