&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years in partnerships and/or sales for high-tech or financial services organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Successful track record in directly managing ISV partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional and technical knowledge, as well as an understanding of industry trends and the key players in the competitive landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to consistently meet and exceed sales targets and quotas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to negotiate high-value deals with a C-level audience and positively influence the outcome&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized self starter with strong multi-tasking skills, who can take ownership, influence others and be efficient in ambiguous situations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s Degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in the financial services/payments industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

