&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of experience in technical Pre-Sales / Solutions Architecture, including 8+ years in a pre-sales leadership position. Ideal candidate will have experience in a similar role leading a partner solution architects org across geos.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 5 years experience building and developing teams across multiple regions.&lt;/li&gt;
