&lt;li&gt;Scope, build, and continuously improve onboarding and ongoing training programs tailored to the unique requirements of each product sales role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay embedded with Product and Product Operations teams to understand Stripe&#39;s evolving product suite, anticipate upcoming releases, and ensure the field is ready before launch&lt;/li&gt;
