&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15+ years of relevant B2B partner marketing experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of direct people management experience, including managing managers and building teams of 5+ people&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working as part of a global marketing team with execution across different regions&lt;/li&gt;
