&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills that demonstrate proven leadership capabilities and ability to collaborate cross-functionally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience shaping value proposition and messaging framework&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience in measuring and improving the ROI of marketing investments through marketing engines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of the user journey through and with a partner channel and funnel, sales cycle and product lifecycle and their respective requirements on the partner marketing organization to drive attach, growth and revenue&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Superb organization and project management skills and the capacity to manage multiple complex projects at once&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in managing distributed teams across different timezones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical skills and the ability to craft actionable insights from complex data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the payments, financial technology, or adjacent industries or marketing FinTech solutions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience at a highly dynamic, high-growth tech company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with demand generation marketing or product marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

