&lt;p&gt;Must have two (2) years of experience in each of the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Authoring and reviewing technical design documents and driving architectural decisions for complex systems while collaborating with junior colleagues;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Building and scaling automated testing and validation frameworks;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Designing and implementing persistent data models using MongoDB; and&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Implementing emerging technical standards for AI/LLMs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary: $190,400 - $285,600/yr&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This salary range represents the base salary range for the role and any sales commissions/sales bonuses targets, if applicable, would be in addition to the base salary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;40 hrs/week&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;50% Telecommuting permitted.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Multiple Positions Available.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Additional benefits for this role may include: equity, company bonus or sales commissions/bonuses; 401(k) plan; medical, dental, and vision benefits; and wellness stipends. &lt;strong&gt;NY59&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
