&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has experience writing production-level code in Scala, Spark, Flink, Airflow, Python, Java, and SQL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has experience designing APIs or building developer platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has experience optimizing the end-to-end performance of distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has experience scaling distributed systems in a fast-moving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has experience working with Airflow infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
