&lt;h2&gt;Who we are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About Stripe&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies, from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups, use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and create new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the gross domestic product of the internet, and we have a significant amount of work ahead. That means you have an opportunity to put the global economy within everyone’s reach while doing some of the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Recruiting team’s mission is to build Stripe’s teams by identifying and attracting people who can help us increase the gross domestic product of the internet. We work closely with business leaders to understand their goals, anticipate talent needs, and develop thoughtful hiring strategies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Go-to-Market (GTM) Sourcer supporting the Americas, you’ll help grow teams across Sales. You’ll partner with recruiters and hiring leaders to understand each role, map relevant talent markets, engage prospective candidates, and build strong pipelines across the United States, Latin America, and Canada.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a strategic, data-oriented Sourcer who can find and engage exceptional GTM talent in competitive and evolving markets. You’ll own the top-of-funnel strategy for a portfolio of roles, translating business needs into targeted sourcing plans and strong candidate pipelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll combine market research, creative outreach, recruiting technology, and internal networks to reach prospective candidates. You’ll also provide recruiters and hiring leaders with clear insights into talent availability, pipeline health, and the changes needed to meet hiring goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with recruiters and hiring leaders to understand hiring goals, role requirements, and the profiles most likely to succeed at Stripe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and run sourcing strategies for GTM roles across Sales and Solutions Architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, engage, and assess prospective candidates, then manage them through the initial stages of the recruiting process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build broad candidate pipelines using direct sourcing, referrals, internal networks, talent communities, events, and other relevant channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct talent research and market mapping to assess talent availability, identify target companies and adjacent profiles, and inform hiring plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use qualitative and quantitative data to evaluate pipeline health, outreach performance, conversion, and sourcing effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
