&lt;li&gt;+7 years of experience in sales, account management, business development, or marketplace growth, preferably in fast-paced or high-growth environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to define and execute market-level strategies in complex and evolving environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to influence without authority and collaborate effectively with cross-functional stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with the ability to translate data into actionable insights and measurable impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to identify high-impact opportunities, diagnose root causes, and design scalable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly proactive, goal-oriented, and self-managed, with strong prioritization and decision-making skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business judgment and ability to operate effectively in ambiguous, fast-changing environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills, both written and verbal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English and Portuguese (mandatory).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with CRM tools (Salesforce preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
