&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Location: Work remotely within China Mainland&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Difference You Will Make:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will lead China social initiatives and drive business growth across key local social channels and reports to the Social Lead.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role focuses on building and scaling Airbnb&#39;s social growth capabilities across local video-driven platforms and evolving social ecosystems. S/he will identify platform opportunities, close operational gaps, and develop scalable approaches to strengthen Airbnb&#39;s brand presence, user engagement, and downstream business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Typical Day:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and drive social growth strategy across &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;video-driven platforms &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;and evolving social ecosystems, identifying platform opportunities and operational gaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and execute social operations including content strategy, content production, audience engagement, and platform growth initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initiate&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; innovative growth pilots&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; to strengthen downstream consideration and conversion, including social content support for livestreaming and community-based social marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with cross-functional stakeholders (Growth Ops, Marketing, Comms, Product, etc.) to align social initiatives with broader business priorities and gain cross-functional support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with global and regional social teams to share insights, advocate for local platform opportunities, and maintain high execution standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current with platform trends, user behaviors, and evolving social ecosystem shifts to continuously improve Airbnb&#39;s local platform growth playbook.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8+ years&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; of experience in social operations, platform operations, content marketing, or social growth-related roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;video-driven local platforms such as Douyin, RedNote video, Bilibili, &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;including platform-native content formats, search and discovery mechanisms, and operational best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience in short-form video content operations, platform growth, or social ecosystem development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience managing local agencies and driving projects forward, with solid knowledge of industry best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management skills with the ability to independently drive complex, cross-functional initiatives end-to-end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong data-driven growth mindset with the ability to identify opportunities and improve performance through data and insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent collaboration and stakeholder management skills across internal teams and external partners/agencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable navigating ambiguity and evolving business priorities while maintaining high-quality execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative, self-motivated, and passionate about social platforms, travel, and evolving consumer behaviors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proficient in English as a working language.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
